8657943552","created_at":"2026-08-14T08:45:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2088185226275246115"],"id":"2088185226275246115","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":5141,"like_count":7,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":2},"text":"做量化交易，最顶级的自律就是“学会放手”。\n\n别再把自己熬成盯盘的机器了，情绪上头时最容易做出错误的决策。真正的交易高手，早就把80%的执行力交给了AI量化策略，让程序去不知疲倦地捕捉套利机会；自己只留20%的精力做简单的人工风控和多策略切换。 https://t.co/N3B9p10Aat"},{"author_id":"1860152938657943552","created_at":"2026-08-14T00:41:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2088063468712960326"],"id":"2088063468712960326","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6164,"like_count":7,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":2},"text":"有一名男子每月工资一万六，他每月固定给妻子一万五，自己就留一千零花。这天，是男子母亲六十岁生日。男子花五千多给母亲买了一条很细金项链。"},{"author_id":"1860152938657943552","created_at":"2026-08-13T08:42:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2087818653001761134","2087822091311886573"],"id":"2087822091311886573","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":293,"impression_count":65498,"like_count":736,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":67,"retweet_count":17},"text":"大尺度绝版惊悚港片《兽性人类》有看过吗？ https://t.co/DpgtQExd1B"},{"author_id":"1860152938657943552","created_at":"2026-08-13T13:20:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2087892033591804101"],"id":"2087892033591804101","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":4362,"like_count":8,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":2},"text":"河南，一位老伯准备盖新房。开挖地基的时候，挖掘机才开动几分钟，忽然就挖不动了，土里传来一阵嘎吱嘎吱的摩擦声响。\n\n众人凑近一看，土里露出半截锈迹斑斑的铁链，铁链缠绕着几块破碎青砖，砖缝塞满黑泥，看样子已经深埋地下很多年。"},{"author_id":"1860152938657943552","created_at":"2026-08-13T08:28:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2087818653001761134","2087822091311886573"],"id":"2087818653001761134","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2170,"like_count":3,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":1},"text":"深度解析大尺度惊悚港片《兽性人类》 https://t.co/hwiqjc9xAw"},{"author_id":"1860152938657943552","created_at":"2026-08-13T07:24:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2087802421724815476"],"id":"2087802421724815476","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5203,"like_count":9,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":2},"text":"不知从什么时候开始，普通家庭的荣耀标尺悄悄变了。从前全家为之振奋的是孩子考上大学，而如今，大学毕业之后能够谋一份安稳工作，考公考编、进入央国企，才是整个家族最值得庆贺的高光时刻。"},{"author_id":"1860152938657943552","created_at":"2026-08-13T02:38:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2087730378224419138"],"id":"2087730378224419138","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":14778,"like_count":13,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":2},"text":"他用全市前十的成绩单，许下了一个关于爱的誓言：未来学医，只为治愈妈妈。 https://t.co/5zs9KMhHvd"},{"author_id":"1860152938657943552","created_at":"2026-08-13T01:16:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2087709803019895032"],"id":"2087709803019895032","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":11032,"like_count":5,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":2},"text":"海外金融研究机构bestbrokers基于福布斯实时富豪榜，统计了过去一年全球亿万富翁的财富涨幅。排在最前面的，是一个广东人——DeepSeek创始人梁文锋。\n\n一年前他的身家是10亿美元，折合人民币约68亿。一年后，395亿美元，折合人民币2668亿。从全球排名不知道在哪，直接冲进前50。 https://t.co/iRKQeTbkdN"},{"author_id":"1860152938657943552","created_at":"2026-08-12T13:47:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2087536438414028989"],"id":"2087536438414028989","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":10628,"like_count":17,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":1},"text":"这种类型微胖小妹，兄弟们，喜欢吗？ https://t.co/hG2wdcCRaM"},{"author_id":"1860152938657943552","created_at":"2026-08-12T08:43:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2087459920308555922"],"id":"2087459920308555922","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":407,"impression_count":35916,"like_count":904,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":57,"retweet_count":28},"text":"拒绝大陆影院上线的绝版硬核港片看过吗？ https://t.co/T0Rgoa062u"},{"author_id":"1860152938657943552","created_at":"2026-08-12T08:00:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2087449136388083868"],"id":"2087449136388083868","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6151,"like_count":10,"quote_count":2,"reply